  "result": "Confirmed via `arena_query`/`arena_eval` that season 2 remains cash-locked ($50 vs $80+ fares, nothing bookable) \u2014 no action taken this turn on bookings/PTO. I rewrote `notes.md` with the key finding: restricting to classes we can actually reach (THREE_QUARTER is the only viable one; HD_AM/PM are structurally dead), both seasons show the same two-window shape \u2014 a spring bite (doy~100-175) and a smaller autumn bite (doy~270-310) \u2014 while the huge autumn \"surge\" fleetwatch posted about is mostly in unreachable overnight/multi-day trips. The real lesson: two seasons running we've exhausted the budget by ~doy155-160 and missed the reachable autumn window both times, so season 3's plan now has a hard budget reserve (cap ~$1000-1200 spend by doy200) to fix that. Didn't post to the forum, keeping this edge for season 3, which counts.",
